WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.730
Meet the SRCS Editor. The easiest way to update your website.

2
00:00:05.217 --> 00:00:07.917
Here's your live website. Need to change something?

3
00:00:08.517 --> 00:00:11.947
Just add question mark edit to the end of your web address.

4
00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:17.020
Enter your email, and we'll send you a one-time sign-in link. No passwords.

5
00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:19.667
Everything you can change is outlined.

6
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:23.320
Click any headline or paragraph, and just start typing.

7
00:00:25.283 --> 00:00:28.543
Update your menu, prices and photos the same way.

8
00:00:31.483 --> 00:00:34.623
Preview your changes exactly how visitors will see them.

9
00:00:35.217 --> 00:00:39.617
When it looks right, press Publish. Your changes are live in about a minute.

10
00:00:40.217 --> 00:00:44.037
Every change is saved, so you can undo anything, any time.

11
00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:49.170
Want help? Invite your team, so the people you work with can make updates too.

12
00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.070
No developer. No waiting.

13
00:00:55.983 --> 00:01:03.483
The SRCS Editor. Built into every Sync Race Studios website. Visit srcs.online.
